        <mxCell id="292" value="NOTES / VERIFY (dense sheet area): • ATTRACT is a NAMED NET (driven elsewhere) — it feeds E1 pin 2 and pin 4 as two loads; corrected here. • NOT YET TRACED (treat as open, NOT N.C.): E1 pins 1, 3, 5, 6 and the 9316 MR(1) clear source. • 9316 load vs enable: H BLANK shown into PE(9); could be CET(10).  CEP/CET tie-highs are inferred. • Preset data P0–P3: A4/B4 (hit detector) vs grounded bits — exact bit map unread. • FF G6 pin roles and G5 decode output names (BALL-H / H-COINC are placeholders)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#fff8e1;strokeColor=#e0a800;dashed=1;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
